{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2023-02", "window": 4, "start_date": 1677024000, "end_date": 1677628799, "month_true_total": 1252, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 19:04:33 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "133831654", "author": {"steamid": "76561198119153581", "personaname": "PlainMilk", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/PlainMilk/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 60, "playtime_forever": 31168, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 30618, "last_played": 1788123333, "avatar": "30570e3da6863ab5affedd5ecd50550983f3738e"}, "language": "english", "review": "I like this game, I've played it on and off for a few years. This game gets consistent updates and new content, for free and has a great community. \nThe reason i give this a thumbsdown is because of I find that the recent updates have left a lot to be desired. I could write paragraphs upon paragraphs as to why I think the Techrot, Zariman, Duviri and other recent 'expansions' and syndicates are boring. But I've learned I'm pretty much alone on this opinion. Which is good, I'm glad others enjoy it, and it's not really fair to complain about grinding, in a F2P game. \nWhere I find the issues lies within the actual Zeigeist of the game, this game is like a 'old boys' club, it is difficult and extremely confusing to new players. Warframe is one of the ONLY games vast majority of my friends wont even bother to even give a try because of it's insane learning wall and grinding. I think DE does a good job with it's art direction since the passing of the lead creative director. But I think adding a dating sim into a space ninjas game is weird and corny. DE seems to be appealing to extremely lonely and gross side of the community, and it is making them hella cash I can presume.", "timestamp_created": 1677628730, "timestamp_updated": 1744159208, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "133830169", "author": {"steamid": "76561198065578856", "personaname": "Tayu", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198065578856/", "num_games_owned": 117, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 43855, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 43341, "last_played": 1768115488, "avatar": "67a4d72e24a90e4af9bbaf218b49a2f9918e53df"}, "language": "english", "review": "do not.", "timestamp_created": 1677626729, "timestamp_updated": 1677626729, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "133830067", "author": {"steamid": "76561199046087934", "personaname": "Kain The Breaker", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199046087934/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 14303, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1678, "last_played": 1773097200, "avatar": "be65902c43f582d8c064c0fed73dceaf885b6455"}, "language": "english", "review": "good", "timestamp_created": 1677626641, "timestamp_updated": 1677626641, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "133829851", "author": {"steamid": "76561199028045924", "personaname": "Baxel Fix", "persona_sta